  "description": ".NET client for large file uploads to Azure Blob Storage through a LargeFileUploader server, from console apps, services, WPF, WinForms, .NET MAUI or Blazor Hybrid. UploadFileAsync sends files in chunks, 4 at a time, with automatic retries, progress reporting and resume after a failure; UploadQueue adds a bindable multi-file queue for your own UI. netstandard2.0, net462 and net8.0.",
